<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id48f5286a-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s4204"><num value="4204">§ 4204.</num><heading> Technical assistance</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The Secretary is encouraged to provide technical assistance to any State or unit of local government, or any nonprofit organization, as determined by the Secretary, that desires to develop programs or policies to limit the conversion of productive farmland to nonagricultural uses.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id48f5286b-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb">(<ref href="/us/pl/97/98/tXV/s1543">Pub. L. 97–98, title XV, § 1543</ref>, <date date="1981-12-22">Dec. 22, 1981</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/95/1343">95 Stat. 1343</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
<notes type="uscNote" id="id48f5286c-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb">
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="statutoryNotes" id="id48f5286d-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered"><b>Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries</b></heading></note>
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="effectiveDate" id="id48f5286e-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Effective Date</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section effective six months after <date date="1981-12-22">Dec. 22, 1981</date>, see <ref href="/us/pl/97/98/s1549">section 1549 of Pub. L. 97–98</ref>, set out as a note under <ref href="/us/usc/t7/s4201">section 4201 of this title</ref>.</p>
</note>
</notes>
